@base = http://localhost:8000

### Registro correcto: 201, cuatro filas nuevas relacionadas, sin password_hash
POST {{base}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alta@example.com","nombre":"Alta Cliente","password":"ClaveNueva99!","documento":"40000001","telefono":"2614000003"}

### Correo repetido: 409 {"detail":"El correo ya está registrado"}; ninguna fila nueva
POST {{base}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alta@example.com","nombre":"Otra","password":"OtraClave99!","documento":"40000002","telefono":"2614000004"}

### Documento repetido: 409 {"detail":"El documento ya está registrado"}; ninguna fila nueva
POST {{base}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"otra@example.com","nombre":"Otra","password":"OtraClave99!","documento":"40000001","telefono":"2614000004"}

### Ficha sin usuario de Jorge: 409 por documento; no vincular ni modificar la ficha
POST {{base}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"jorge-nuevo@example.com","nombre":"Otra","password":"OtraClave99!","documento":"28333444","telefono":"2614000004"}

